/*\n  # Fix Punchlist Invites to Allow Null Project ID\n\n  ## Summary\n  Makes the project_id column nullable in pending_punchlist_invites to support\n  manual invites created for customers without an associated project.\n\n  ## Changes\n  - Alter project_id column to allow NULL values\n  - This enables the create_manual_punchlist_invite function to work correctly\n  - Manual invites can now be created for any contact at any time\n\n  ## Background\n  The create_manual_punchlist_invite function was added to allow staff to manually\n  create invites without a project, but the table constraint was preventing this.\n*/\n\n-- Make project_id nullable to support manual invites without projects\nALTER TABLE pending_punchlist_invites\n  ALTER COLUMN project_id DROP NOT NULL

\n
